<title>USA: Park City Sch Dist, Utah won by Hutchinson.</title>
<headline>Park City Sch Dist, Utah won by Hutchinson.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hutchinson, Shockey, Erley &amp; Co. said it won $17.555 million of Park City School District, Utah, general obligation school building bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.07 percent.</p>
